  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFFIm Gavi  2021 - 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFFIm issues vaccine bonds in the capital markets and repay these bonds with long-term donor pledges. IFFIm will frontload longterm pledges made by the Norwegian Government to Gavi&apos;s strategic mandate.</narrative>
  </description>
